-- An exported rule that reads an ASSUME of type DEONTIC that another module
-- declares. A request has no value for it, and no JSON form for a DEONTIC, so
-- `l4 check` and `l4 deploy` refuse the rule.
IMPORT facts

@export Is the imported duty fulfilled
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`imported duty fulfilled` MEANS
  CONSIDER `imported duty`
  WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
  OTHERWISE FALSE
